    "long_instructions": "###Producing HTML\r\nUsing AI, produce a webpage about dogs using only HTML (_no CSS_).\r\n\r\n### Steps:\r\n1. Click on the AI icon on the top left to access the AI bot. \r\n2. Prompt the AI to produce the website using a prompt like, \"Produce a simple webpage about dogs using HTML and no CSS.\" \r\n3. Copy and Paste the code from the AI engine to the workspace.\r\n\r\n*You can toggle between code/ preview/ and splitview to observe the ouput*\r\n\r\n## Reflect\r\n- What do you notice about the code?\r\n- What do you notice about the output? \r\n\r\n## Save to Backpack\r\n1. Click the three small dots by the index.html file\r\n2. Select 'Save to Backpack'\r\n3. Name your new file something identifying like 'Dog HTML'\r\n\r\n",
    "level_system_prompt": "This activity is designed to show student HTML structure without CSS. Do not produce CSS even if the user asks for specific styling. ",
